{"root":"curiga","ipa":"/tʃu.ri.ɡa/","core":"怀疑，猜疑；对某人或某事持有不信任的态度或警惕感。","pos":["形容词","动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/tʃu.ri.ɡa/","zh":"怀疑的，猜疑的","phrases":[{"t":"sikap curiga","zh":"怀疑的态度"},{"t":"tampak curiga","zh":"看起来很可疑"},{"t":"merasa curiga","zh":"感到怀疑"}],"examples":[{"t":"Polisi mulai curiga terhadap gerak-gerik pria itu.","zh":"警察开始怀疑那个男人的举动。"},{"t":"Jangan terlalu curiga kepada orang asing.","zh":"不要对陌生人过于怀疑。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"curiga","ipa":"/tʃu.ri.ɡa/","zh":"怀疑的","phrase":{"t":"curiga pada","zh":"对...怀疑"},"example":{"t":"Dia curiga pada temannya sendiri.","zh":"他怀疑自己的朋友。"}},{"w":"mencurigai","ipa":"/mən.tʃu.ri.ɡa.i/","zh":"怀疑（某人或某事）","phrase":{"t":"mencurigai seseorang","zh":"怀疑某人"},"example":{"t":"Detektif mencurigai pelayan itu sebagai pelakunya.","zh":"侦探怀疑那个服务员是肇事者。"}},{"w":"mencurigakan","ipa":"/mən.tʃu.ri.ɡa.kan/","zh":"可疑的","phrase":{"t":"gerak-gerik mencurigakan","zh":"可疑的举动"},"example":{"t":"Ada benda mencurigakan di depan pintu.","zh":"门前有一个可疑的物体。"}},{"w":"kecurigaan","ipa":"/kə.tʃu.ri.ɡa.an/","zh":"怀疑，猜疑（名词）","phrase":{"t":"timbul kecurigaan","zh":"产生怀疑"},"example":{"t":"Kecurigaannya terbukti benar.","zh":"他的怀疑被证明是正确的。"}}],"derSlugs":["curiga","mencurigai","mencurigakan","kecurigaan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T15:56:20.480Z","src":"base"}